      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.76,
      "end_seconds": 15.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.97,
      "text": "yes, have a seat. Tell me what's going on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 17.42,
      "end_seconds": 22.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "So the the thing is, I've got no real problems."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.08,
      "end_seconds": 27.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "How long has it it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.69,
      "end_seconds": 36.74,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "I've had it for five days i thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.79,
      "end_seconds": 42.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 43.98,
      "end_seconds": 50.27,
      "duration_seconds": 6.29,
      "text": "pretty severe, if I'm being honest. Oh, and a bit of back stiffness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.01,
      "end_seconds": 70.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "Any chest pain or shortness of breath at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.59,
      "end_seconds": 74.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "No, I'd have said so."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.27,
      "end_seconds": 76.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "How about weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.76,
      "end_seconds": 81.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Nope, no weight loss."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.17,
      "end_seconds": 85.84,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.41,
      "end_seconds": 89.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "No, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.4,
      "end_seconds": 93.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 95.89,
      "end_seconds": 106.62,
      "duration_seconds": 10.73,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years. I walk the dog every morning. No, I share a house with my brother"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.65,
      "end_seconds": 115.35,
      "duration_seconds": 3.7,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.59,
      "end_seconds": 118.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "Yes, high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.25,
      "end_seconds": 124.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.29,
      "end_seconds": 129.3,
      "duration_seconds": 4.01,
      "text": "No, you know, not that I know of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.92,
      "end_seconds": 146.43,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Right, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.88,
      "end_seconds": 149.89,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "It's rosuvastatin, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 150.78,
      "end_seconds": 153.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "And what strength is that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 154.66,
      "end_seconds": 158.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "10 milligrams, I think that's what's on the box."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.17,
      "end_seconds": 178.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.41,
      "end_seconds": 193.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.26,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.39,
      "end_seconds": 215.56,
      "duration_seconds": 9.17,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 84, respiratory rate 18, temperature 36.8, pressure 109 over 69, oxygen saturation is 97 percent."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.93,
      "end_seconds": 219.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.52,
      "end_seconds": 223.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I'll come back to the numbers."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.73,
      "end_seconds": 231.77,
      "duration_seconds": 6.04,
      "text": "So, I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 233.36,
      "end_seconds": 235.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.6,
      "end_seconds": 255.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Your heart and lungs sound normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 265.16,
      "end_seconds": 266.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "Yeah, no problem."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.02,
      "end_seconds": 303.36,
      "duration_seconds": 33.34,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Putting it all together, my working impression is a healthy adult with no worrying findings. I'm going to order a fasting sugar test, for routine check. Keep up regular exercise and a balanced diet. If it hasn't settled next month, we'd think about a cholesterol blood test, but not now. One warning sign to remember: new symptoms appear. In that case don't wait. I'd like to see you again in twelve months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.84,
      "end_seconds": 305.54,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "right"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.43,
      "end_seconds": 314.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.22,
      "end_seconds": 319.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "I think I understand everything thanks"
    }
  ]
